# 12. Search Is Not Recommendations

Keep these concepts separate.

### Search

> "I know what I want. Show it to me."

### Recommendations

> "I don't know what I want. Help me find it."

### Personalized FundLens

> "Now that I'm looking at this fund, tell me what matters for me."

This distinction must remain visible in both UX and code architecture.

