# 13. Presentation Profile

The backend/personalization layer should eventually provide:

```json
{
  "mode": "beginner",
  "priority_metrics": [
    "goal_fit",
    "downside",
    "long_term_return",
    "consistency",
    "cost"
  ],
  "explanation_depth": "simple",
  "default_chart": "growth_of_10000",
  "show_advanced_toggle": true
}
```

The frontend uses this to determine:

- Which cards appear.
- Card ordering.
- Default chart.
- Explanation depth.
- Terminology level.
- Which explanations are expanded.

The frontend must not invent the financial methodology behind these priorities.

