# 24. Explanation System

Every important metric should support three disclosure levels.

### Level 1: Conclusion

> Higher downside risk.

### Level 2: Explanation

> This fund has experienced larger temporary falls than similar funds.

### Level 3: Evidence

```text
Maximum drawdown: -18.4%
Peak: Apr 2020
Trough: Jun 2020
Recovery: 11 months
```

Pattern:

```text
Conclusion
   ↓
Explanation
   ↓
Evidence
```

