# 25. Trust and Financial Safety

Frontend rules:

- [ ] Distinguish historical facts from interpretation.
- [ ] Show data freshness where relevant.
- [ ] Missing data must not become zero.
- [ ] Derived labels must have a methodology.
- [ ] Do not imply guaranteed returns.
- [ ] Keep evidence accessible.
- [ ] Do not manufacture confidence from weak data.
- [ ] Make recommendation/context logic inspectable.

Prefer:

> Why we surfaced this: 10+ year history + relevant category + manageable historical drawdown.

Avoid:

> This is a great fund for you!

