# 28. Beginner Usability Acceptance Criteria

A Beginner screen passes only if users can identify:

- [ ] What is good.
- [ ] What is risky.
- [ ] What happened historically.
- [ ] Why the fund appeared.
- [ ] What to do next.

without requiring a finance tutorial.

### Visual comprehension test

Hide labels from a visual and ask:

> "What do you think this is telling you?"

If users consistently misunderstand it, redesign the visual before adding more explanatory text.

