# 35. The Product We Are Actually Building

The end state is not simply:

> "Choose Beginner or Advanced."

The stronger product is:

> **FundLens determines what information is most useful for this investor, then lets them choose how deeply they want to inspect it.**

The progression should be:

```text
Generic information
       ↓
Relevant information
